# Day 18 - Brain Dump Action Planner Skill

## Objective
Build a reusable Claude Skill that converts messy notes, meeting transcripts, brainstorming sessions, and voice memos into structured action plans and dashboards.

## What I Learned

### Custom Skills
Claude Skills can store reusable workflows and execute them automatically without repeating prompts.

### Information Management
Transform unstructured notes into:
- Summaries
- Action Items
- Decisions
- Risks
- Open Questions

### Dashboard Generation
Generate interactive HTML dashboards from notes and transcripts.

### Productivity Improvement
Reduce manual organization work and improve clarity.

## Skill Created

Skill Name:
brain-dump-action-planner

Purpose:
Convert raw notes into actionable project plans and dashboards.

## Features

- Summary Generation
- Key Takeaways
- Action Items Table
- Open Questions Tracking
- Risks & Blockers Analysis
- Conflict Detection
- Transcript Analysis
- Merge Multiple Notes

## Test Case

Used sample meeting notes to generate:

- Project Dashboard
- Task List
- Risk Analysis
- Open Questions

## Key Learning

Claude Skills act like reusable AI workflows.

Once created, the skill can be triggered repeatedly without re-entering the complete instructions.

## Outcome

Successfully built and tested a Brain Dump Action Planner Skill that transforms chaotic information into structured project dashboards.
